OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDocumentary series. The GPs face
OL,7,     Fan unusual number of cases that
OL,8,     Frequire hospital treatment,
OL,9,     Fincluding Wendy's infected cat
OL,10,     Fbite, John's nasty head cut and
OL,11,     FIbraheem's broken wrist.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FA lorry driver is rushed in after
OL,14,     Fa country lane crash, an
OL,15,     F82-year-old who collapsed shows
OL,16,     Fsigns of confusion, and a mum
OL,17,     Fworries about her daughter's head
OL,18,     Finjury.
