OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FBirmingham, Norwich, and Maidstone
OL,7,     FA&E teams face intense challenges,
OL,8,     Ffrom gunshot wounds to heart
OL,9,     Femergencies and assaults, showing
OL,10,     Ftheir resilience under pressure.
OL,11,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,12,     FA man has been crushed by a
OL,13,     Fforklift truck and sustained a
OL,14,     Fserious leg injury, and a
OL,15,     F22-year-old woman is trapped in
OL,16,     Fher car with a badly injured ankle
OL,17,     Fafter a high-speed collision.
OL,18,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,19,     FInsight at a specialist clinic
OL,20,     Fwhere four top dermatologists
OL,21,     Ftreat a range of conditions.
